Package: ytdata
Title: Fetch Yukon Open Geospatial Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alex M.", "Chubaty", , "achubaty@for-cast.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7146-8135"))
Description: Lightweight helpers to fetch Government of Yukon open geospatial
    data from the GeoYukon ArcGIS REST services as 'sf' objects, with a small
    registry of commonly used layers (there is no 'bcdata'-style package for
    Yukon).
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/FOR-CAST/ytdata
BugReports: https://github.com/FOR-CAST/ytdata/issues
Imports:
    cli,
    httr2,
    sf
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
